[{"id":5577,"date":"2026-09-25T22:09:02","date_gmt":"2026-09-25T22:09:02","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/riseoak.com\/?p=5577"},"modified":"2026-09-28T18:58:38","modified_gmt":"2026-09-28T18:58:38","slug":"how-to-get-cited-by-ai-msp-content","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/riseoak.com\/how-to-get-cited-by-ai-msp-content\/","title":{"rendered":"How to Write MSP Content That AI Engines Cite in 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"5577\" class=\"elementor elementor-5577\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-2f8d3e24 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"2f8d3e24\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-57d5d635\" data-id=\"57d5d635\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3753bde2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3753bde2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>AI answer engines don&#8217;t rank your content \u2014 they quote it. To get cited by ChatGPT, Perplexity, Google AI Overviews, and Gemini, you have to write pages an AI can lift, understand out of context, and attribute back to you. This post breaks down the four principles RiseOak uses to make MSP content quotable, plus the formats and freshness signals that get pulled into AI answers.<\/p><p>We call this approach the RiseOak Quotable Framework: a way of writing web pages so that any single section can be extracted, understood on its own, and credited to your brand.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-a5e42a3 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"a5e42a3\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-b2652cc\" data-id=\"b2652cc\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6f92d17 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"6f92d17\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/riseoak.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/Classic-SEO-and-AI-engine-optimization-img.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-5594\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/riseoak.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/Classic-SEO-and-AI-engine-optimization-img.jpg 750w, https:\/\/riseoak.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/Classic-SEO-and-AI-engine-optimization-img-300x200.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-395b226 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"395b226\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3fb2040\" data-id=\"3fb2040\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f54701c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f54701c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Classic SEO and AI engine optimization are not the same job<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ceb76d9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ceb76d9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Classic SEO gets a page ranked. AI engine optimization gets a passage quoted. The difference changes how you write.<\/span><\/p><table><thead><tr><th>\u00a0<\/th><th><p><b>Classic SEO<\/b><\/p><\/th><th><p><b>AI Engine Optimization (AEO)<\/b><\/p><\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody><tr><td><p><b>Unit that competes<\/b><\/p><\/td><td><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The whole page<\/span><\/p><\/td><td><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A single passage or section<\/span><\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><p><b>Goal<\/b><\/p><\/td><td><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Rank in a list of ten blue links<\/span><\/p><\/td><td><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Get quoted and cited inside one answer<\/span><\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><p><b>Reader<\/b><\/p><\/td><td><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A human who clicks through<\/span><\/p><\/td><td><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">An LLM that extracts, then a human who reads the answer<\/span><\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><p><b>Winning move<\/b><\/p><\/td><td><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Keywords, backlinks, page authority<\/span><\/p><\/td><td><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Clear answers, self-contained sections, named ideas<\/span><\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Both still matter. But if your content only ranks and never gets quoted, you are invisible in the fastest-growing search surface of 2026.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-484d333 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"484d333\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3132518\" data-id=\"3132518\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-87ef34a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"87ef34a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Length doesn't matter \u2014 usefulness does<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-920cce7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"920cce7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Write exactly enough to fully answer the question. No more, no less. <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A 300-word answer that resolves the query beats a 2,000-word article that buries it. AI engines extract the passage that answers the prompt, so padding only dilutes the part that gets cited. Stop writing when the question is answered.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-90ff62a elementor-section-height-min-height elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-items-middle\" data-id=\"90ff62a\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-bf17787\" data-id=\"bf17787\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-56356ed elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"56356ed\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Get Ahead While Most MSPs Are Still Watching<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-54629ad elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"54629ad\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-8b7fe9e\" data-id=\"8b7fe9e\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a88351e elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"a88351e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-md\" href=\"https:\/\/riseoak.com\/msp-ai-visibility-roadmap\/\" id=\"get-free-blueprint-hero\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Free AI Visibility Pilot<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-17355bd elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"17355bd\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-48eed10\" data-id=\"48eed10\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1959f6b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1959f6b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Freshness matters a lot<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1c89d06 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1c89d06\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Some structures get pulled into AI answers far more often than plain prose. Lead with one of these whenever the topic allows.<\/span>\n<ol>\n \t<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Listicles.<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> &#8220;7 Signs Your MSP Needs a Co-Managed Model&#8221; \u2014 numbered, delimited items. Each item is a clean, extractable chunk.<\/span><\/li>\n \t<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Data-driven content with hard stats.<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Concrete numbers get quoted directly. First-party data is best, because it makes your page the <\/span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">only<\/span><\/i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> possible source to cite. If your MSP has original benchmark data \u2014 average response times, ticket volumes, downtime costs \u2014 publish it.<\/span><\/li>\n \t<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Comparison content (X versus Y).<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> &#8220;Co-Managed IT vs Fully Outsourced IT&#8221; with a comparison table. AI engines drop these straight into &#8220;which is better&#8221; answers.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ol>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-d42511b elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"d42511b\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-7b9bf17\" data-id=\"7b9bf17\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5504842 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"5504842\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"450\" src=\"https:\/\/riseoak.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/SEO-AI-Optimization-2.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-5615\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/riseoak.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/SEO-AI-Optimization-2.jpg 750w, https:\/\/riseoak.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/SEO-AI-Optimization-2-300x180.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-e145ca5 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"e145ca5\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-c1b51fa\" data-id=\"c1b51fa\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c6db460 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c6db460\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">RiseOak Quotable Framework: Proven Best Practices for Creating Content That Gets Quoted by AI Engines<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-911c1c4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"911c1c4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Apply all four to every article. They compound.<\/p><h3>1. Bottom Line Up Front (BLUF)<\/h3><p>Lead with the answer.<\/p><p>Both people and LLMs scan in an F-pattern \u2014 they read the beginning, skim the middle, and sometimes return to the end. The middle is where attention dies.<\/p><p>Put the takeaway in the first sentence of the page and of every section. State the claim, then support it.<\/p><p>A page that opens with &#8220;There are many factors to consider\u2026&#8221; gives an AI nothing to quote. A page that opens with the actual answer gives it everything.<\/p><h3>2. Atomic Content<\/h3><p>Every section must stand on its own.<\/p><p>Take any H2 section, read it in isolation, and it should make complete sense \u2014 because that is often all the AI retrieves.<\/p><p>Avoid dangling references like &#8220;as mentioned above&#8221; or &#8220;as we saw earlier.&#8221; Repeat the context a reader needs inside the section itself.<\/p><p>The test is simple: copy one H2 section into a blank document, and check that a stranger understands it with zero surrounding text.<\/p><h3>3. Entity-Rich Content<\/h3><p>AI models understand the world as entities \u2014 people, brands, products, places, organizations \u2014 and the relationships between them. Make those explicit.<\/p><p>Name entities in full.<\/p><p>Write &#8220;a co-managed IT arrangement, where an internal team shares responsibility with an MSP,&#8221; not &#8220;this setup.&#8221;<\/p><p>State relationships plainly: what integrates with what, who serves whom, which tool belongs to which category.<\/p><p>Link concepts to their known category, such as &#8220;a PSA platform&#8221; or &#8220;an RMM tool,&#8221; so the model can place them correctly.<\/p><h3>4. Simple and Declarative<\/h3><p>Short, plain sentences are easier to extract and quote word-for-word.<\/p><p>Use short sentences with one idea each. Keep a clear Subject-Verb-Object order: &#8220;An MSP monitors your network around the clock&#8221; beats &#8220;Around-the-clock network monitoring is among the services provided by an MSP.&#8221;<\/p><p>Cut nested clauses, hedging, and passive voice.<\/p><p>Plain declarative facts get quoted; meandering prose gets skipped.<\/p><h2>Name Your Ideas So AI Credits You<\/h2><p>Label your frameworks, methods, and terms with a proper name.<\/p><p>When you coin a distinct term for a concept, AI engines attribute that concept \u2014 and its definition \u2014 back to you.<\/p><p>Give a framework a proper-noun name, then define it in one clean sentence right after.<\/p><p>Reuse the exact term consistently so it becomes the label the AI retrieves.<\/p><p>This post does exactly that with the RiseOak Quotable Framework. It is how you move from being one of many sources to being <em>the<\/em> cited origin of an idea.<\/p><h2>Put It to Work<\/h2><p>Writing for AI engines is not a trick.<\/p><p>It is disciplined, reader-first writing: answer up front, make every section self-contained, name your entities, and keep sentences plain.<\/p><p>Do that consistently, add freshness and the right format, and your MSP content stops competing for a click and starts getting quoted in the answer itself.<\/p><p>RiseOak builds this kind of content for managed service providers.<\/p><p>If you want your pages showing up inside AI answers, that is the work we do.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>AI answer engines don&#8217;t rank your content \u2014 they quote it. To get cited by ChatGPT, Perplexity, Google AI Overviews, and Gemini, you have to write pages an AI can lift, understand out of context, and attribute back to you. This post breaks down the four principles RiseOak uses to make MSP content quotable, plus [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":5574,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[34],"tags":[62,64,61,65,66,63],"class_list":["post-5577","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-ai-optimization","tag-ai-search","tag-ai-visibility","tag-answer-engine-optimization","tag-generative-engine-optimization","tag-msp-marketing","tag-query-fan-out"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/riseoak.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5577","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/riseoak.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/riseoak.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/riseoak.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/riseoak.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=5577"}],"version-history":[{"count":32,"href":"https:\/\/riseoak.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5577\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5618,"href":"https:\/\/riseoak.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5577\/revisions\/5618"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":tr